WEBVTT

00:06:00.022 --> 00:06:02.191
I would have said,
"I believe that's my seat,"

00:06:02.191 --> 00:06:05.111
and the guy immediately
would have looked at his boarding pass

00:06:05.111 --> 00:06:06.404
and said, "Oh, I'm sorry."

00:06:06.404 --> 00:06:07.613
I know that

00:06:07.613 --> 00:06:09.824
because it happened all the time.

00:06:10.908 --> 00:06:13.536
The flight attendant
took our boarding passes,

00:06:13.577 --> 00:06:17.373
she said to the guy,
"Sir, you're in 1C, she's in 1D."

00:06:17.373 --> 00:06:18.916
I put his stuff down in 1C,

00:06:18.958 --> 00:06:20.918
he said not one single word.

00:06:20.918 --> 00:06:23.712
And of course, you know
who was next to me in 1F.

00:06:24.505 --> 00:06:27.216
Mister "Would you take
your effing argument elsewhere?"

00:06:27.258 --> 00:06:28.426
(Laughter)

00:06:28.759 --> 00:06:31.095
So my friend Karen,
who works for American,